<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-028" chapter-id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses" source-id="s-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses-ws1511857">
  <p id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAC">褚裕之</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0004" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAC">叔度</persName>，河南陽翟人，晉太傅<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0016" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">裒</persName>之曽孫也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0023" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAA">歆</persName>，秘書監。父<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0030" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">爽</persName>，金紫光禄大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAACA">寂之</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0003" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAACAA">曖</persName>尚宋文帝第六女<persName id="c-nanshi-028-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0011" ref="3bh_k4m_fg4_D">琅邪貞長公主</persName>，位太宰參軍，亦早卒。</p>
</text>
